    "body": "In Safari TP both writes succeed. Live demo at https://ns-vjdobvkxnz.now.sh\r\n\r\nSo it sounds like the spec is reasonably right here, although we should consider filing bugs on Safari and Chrome to get them to disallow writes on non-active documents. And we should write web platform tests for this stuff if we haven't already. Do you agree?",
